      "description": "• A how-to video on product usage that demonstrates how to clean a submersible tabletop fountain pump, covering disassembly, rinsing, scrubbing, and reassembly of all parts. • Disassembly involves removing the front cover, twisting off the impeller cover, and pulling out the magnetic impeller using a small tool such as a paperclip to access all internal components. • Cleaning is done by submerging the pump body and all parts in clean water and scrubbing with a small brush to remove buildup and debris, then reassembling by reinserting the impeller, twisting the impeller cover back into the locked position, and snapping the front cover on.",
